        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "==Ping== every **20–30s**, pong timeout about 20s",
            "Proxy idle timeout **longer** than the ping interval",
            "No heartbeat → a proxy silently drops idle links"
          ],
          "style": "check",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "green"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "**Always** `await ws.send()`, never fire-and-forget",
            "Bounded `asyncio.Queue(maxsize=N)`, never unbounded",
            "Each consumer gets a ==drop / disconnect== policy",
            "`await asyncio.wait_for(ws.send(m), 5)` for slow peers"
          ],
          "style": "checkbox",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "purple"
        },
